  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Square Frame, The Living Products",
    "overview": "NOXXD is two layers, never blended. The outer layer is the agency itself: a retro-industrial, 8-bit refined world of deep teal ground, a gold blueprint grid, strictly right-angled shapes, Oswald capitals and the wide-tracked Josefin slogan \"BUILD IT YOUR WAY\". It owns the Home page outright and, on every case page, the sticky top bar and the gold footer band.\n\nThe inner layer belongs to each product. Between the NOXXD bar and footer, a case page speaks in its product's own palette, type and corner radius, set through one shared contract of `--p-*` custom properties (background, text, text-2, accent, accent-hover, on-accent, focus, chip, radius, radius-sm, head and body font). The shared primitives (buttons, sections, chips, screenshot slots, CTA band) read only those properties, so a fourth product is a new token block, not new components. Each world shows the product's real state vocabulary as its visual signature: Urbis's occurrence statuses, HealthSearch's NR compliance traffic light, CARITAS's document stack.\n\nDensity is moderate and editorial. Motion is short, transform-only, and settles once; every animation disappears under `prefers-reduced-motion`.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Two-layer system: NOXXD frame (square, teal, gold) around a per-product world (`--p-*` tokens).",
      "Zero radius everywhere in the NOXXD layer; product radii only inside the frame.",
      "Blueprint grid and 8-bit pixel ornaments (checker dividers, stepped corner tabs, floating gold squares) belong to NOXXD alone.",
      "Each product world is pinned to its official palette and fonts, never reinterpreted.",
      "Bilingual PT/EN everywhere; motion is decoration, never the carrier of state."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Deep Ink On Gold Rule",
        "body": "Text and icons on gold use Abyss Teal (#0E363E, 5.1:1). Blueprint Teal on gold fails AA and is not allowed.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Frame Wears The Product Rule",
        "body": "Gold, teal and the blueprint grid belong to the NOXXD layer (the Home page and the frame defaults). On a case page the bar and footer keep the NOXXD signature (emblem, Oswald uppercase, square controls) but take the product palette through the --nx-* / --nxf-* tokens set in that page; a product world never borrows gold or teal.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The State Vocabulary Rule",
        "body": "Inside a product world, the only hues besides the brand palette are the product's own state colours (Urbis statuses, the HealthSearch traffic light and ASO pre-states). No decorative extra hues.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Uppercase Belongs To NOXXD Rule",
        "body": "Uppercase, tracked type is the frame's voice. Product worlds set headings in sentence case with negative tracking.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Bilingual Slogan Rule",
        "body": "The slogan follows the page language: \"CONSTRUA DO SEU JEITO\" in Portuguese, \"BUILD IT YOUR WAY\" in English, always set in tracked Josefin uppercase. It never sits inside the top-bar lockup, which is emblem plus NOXXD wordmark only.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Frame Rule",
        "body": "No shadow is ever cast in the NOXXD layer. The pixel-tab box-shadows on cards duplicate corner squares; they are ornament, not elevation.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Radius Lives Inside Rule",
        "body": "Radius is a product property, set through `--p-radius` and `--p-radius-sm`. It never reaches the NOXXD bar, footer or Home.",
        "section": "shapes"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** put #0E363E ink on every gold surface.",
      "**Do** theme a new case page only through a `--p-*` and `--shot-*` token block, with the NOXXD bar and footer unchanged.",
      "**Do** keep the NOXXD layer at 0px radius with 2px gold borders and pixel ornaments.",
      "**Do** use each product's official palette, fonts and logo from its spec in `Exemplos/`.",
      "**Do** carry state in text, such as a visible label or a visually hidden bilingual summary. Hover and motion only decorate.",
      "**Do** animate transform and opacity only, and remove all motion under `prefers-reduced-motion`.",
      "**Do** provide every visible string in both `lang=\"pt-BR\"` and `lang=\"en\"`."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** set Blueprint Teal (#1B5E6B) text on gold; it fails AA.",
      "**Don't** round anything in the NOXXD layer, and don't bring gold, the blueprint grid or pixel ornaments into a product world.",
      "**Don't** add hues to a product world beyond its brand palette and its own state colours.",
      "**Don't** cast shadows in the NOXXD layer.",
      "**Don't** translate \"BUILD IT YOUR WAY\" or spell the name other than NOXXD."
    ]
  }
}